<p>You delight in the inflicting of wounds, providing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100">18, 23, 27, 31, 34</acronym> physical power.</p><p>In addition when you make a creature bleed its physical damage resistance is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 20%, 27%, 34%, 40%</acronym> (but never below 0%).</p><p>Physical power depends on your Strength stat.</p>